---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import PageIntro from "../components/PageIntro.astro";

const updated = "July 11, 2026";
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="How ConvertBrio collects, uses, and protects your data and files.">
  <PageIntro eyebrow={`Last updated ${updated}`} title="Privacy Policy" />

  <section class="bg-canvas">
    <div class="container-page py-16 sm:py-20">
      <article class="prose prose-neutral max-w-2xl prose-headings:font-semibold prose-headings:tracking-[-0.01em] prose-a:text-brand-600 prose-a:no-underline hover:prose-a:underline">
        <p>
          ConvertBrio (“we”, “us”, or “our”) provides online tools for converting, compressing,
          and enhancing files. This policy explains what information we collect, how we use it,
          and the choices you have.
        </p>

        <h2>1. Information we collect</h2>
        <p>
          We collect account information you provide (such as your name and email address),
          usage data (such as which tools you use), and technical data (such as browser type and
          IP address) needed to operate the service securely.
        </p>

        <h2>2. Files you upload</h2>
        <p>
          Files you upload are transmitted over an encrypted connection and processed
          automatically to perform the requested conversion. We do not review, share, or use the
          contents of your files for any purpose other than delivering the result you requested.
          Uploaded and converted files are permanently deleted from our servers within 24 hours.
        </p>

        <h2>3. How we use information</h2>
        <p>
          We use collected information to operate and improve ConvertBrio, provide customer
          support, monitor for abuse, and comply with legal obligations. We do not sell your
          personal information.
        </p>

        <h2>4. Cookies</h2>
        <p>
          We use a small number of cookies to keep you signed in and to understand aggregate
          usage of the site. You can disable cookies in your browser, though some features may
          not work correctly as a result.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Third-party services</h2>
        <p>
          We rely on a small number of infrastructure providers (such as cloud hosting and
          payment processors) to operate ConvertBrio. These providers only receive the
          information necessary to perform their function.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Your rights</h2>
        <p>
          Depending on where you live, you may have the right to access, correct, or delete your
          personal information. To exercise these rights, contact us at
          <a href="mailto:privacy@convertbrio.com">privacy@convertbrio.com</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>7. Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this policy from time to time. If we make material changes, we will
          notify you by updating the date at the top of this page.
        </p>

        <h2>8. Contact us</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about this policy can be sent to
          <a href="mailto:privacy@convertbrio.com">privacy@convertbrio.com</a> or via our
          <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
